.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
C-API: File callbacks\&. 

Actually, it's a data structure to wrap a set of fXXXX (e\&.g fopen) replacement functions\&.
.PP
The default implementation of the functions utilizes the fXXX functions from the CRT\&. However, you can supply a custom implementation to \fBAssimp\fP by delivering a custom \fBaiFileIO\fP\&. Use this to enable reading from other sources, such as ZIP archives or memory locations\&. 
.SH "Member Data Documentation"
